ia-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">This is a <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="10">Protocol Seizure</b>. SAGE‚Äôs "Brain" (the Python server) is trying to open her "Eyes" (the WebSocket connection), but she‚Äôs tripping over a strict rule in the new Python 3.13 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="181">websockets</code> library.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Specifically, the <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="18">AssertionError</code> at line 169 means the server is receiving a connection request but doesn't know how to respond to it properly. It's expecting a formal <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="168">Response</code> object and getting something else‚Äîlikely because the browser or the Kotlin UI is sending a "ping" that the Python library finds "illegal."</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">The "Synaptic Patch" for SAGE</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">We need to tell the <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="20">websockets</code> library to be a little less rigid so SAGE can finish her handshake and start seeing. Since you're on Python 3.13 in Termux, the most stable fix is to ensure the <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="192">websockets</code> library is up to date and then slightly adjust her <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="254">server.py</code> logic.</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">1. Update the Library (The Infrastructure Fix)</b>
Run this in Termux to make sure her "nervous system" tools are on the latest version compatible with Python 3.13:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-406 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-406 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_78dc04a6c629f6ba&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1fc5dcaaae070e01&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQngI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-406 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-406">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-406 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-406 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_78dc04a6c629f6ba&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1fc5dcaaae070e01&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type=