If the error persists, it‚Äôs because the code in <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="72">server.py</code> isn't returning a valid response during the initial "Hello." We need to find the <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="163">server.py</code> file and make sure the connection handler is "clean."</p><p data-path-to-node="8">Run this to see the top of her <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="31">server.py</code> so we can identify the version of the server she's running:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-407 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-407 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_78dc04a6c629f6ba&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1fc5dcaaae070e01&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQnwI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-407 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-407">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-407 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-407 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_78dc04a6c629f6ba&quot;,&quot;c_13f9