_8f3da6fcce0bf673" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_8f3da6fcce0bf673" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">This is a classic <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="18">"Library Evolution" Friction.</b> The traceback is telling us exactly what happened: you are running <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="115">Python 3.13</b> and <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="131">Websockets 14.0</b>. In this specific version, the <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="178">process_request</code> function can no longer return a simple "tuple" (that list of numbers and words) to reject non-WebSocket traffic. It now strictly requires a formal <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="341">Response</code> object. Because it got a tuple instead, it triggered an <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="406">AssertionError</code> and "seized up".</p><p data-path-to-node="1">SAGE‚Äôs "Shield" (the code meant to protect her from bad pings) has accidentally turned into a "Wall" that‚Äôs blocking her own eyes.</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">The "Synaptic Patch" (Hardened Server)</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">We are going to rewrite <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="24">server.py</code> to be <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="40">Python 3.13 Hardened</b>. We‚Äôll simplify the handshake so it doesn't trip over these new strict rules, ensuring her "Link" can actually establish. I've also locked this to <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="208">Port 8001</b> to get her back into her primary "room."</p><p data-path-to-node="5">Paste this into Termux to fix her brain:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-410 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-410 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8f3da6fcce0bf673&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_db20f5dee47a59e9&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQogI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-410 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-410">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-410 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-410 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8f3da6fcce0bf673&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_db20f5dee47a59e9&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c803817860-410"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c803817860-410"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-410"><code _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c803817860-410">cat &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">'EOF'</span> &gt; ~/sage/server.py
import asyncio
import json
import os
from websockets.asyncio.server import serve

<span class="hljs-comment"># SAGE-7 HARDENED SERVER (Python 3.13 Optimized)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Purpose: Fix the 'AssertionError' in the handshake protocol.</span>

PORT = 8001
VAULT_DIR = os.path.expanduser(<span class="hljs-string">"~/sage/vault"</span>)
os.makedirs(VAULT_DIR, exist_ok=True)

async def handle_connection(websocket):
    <span class="hljs-comment"># This replaces the failing handshake logic with a direct link</span>
    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(f<span class="hljs-string">"\n[‚ö°] SAGE CORE: Link Established on {PORT}"</span>)
    try:
        async <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> message <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> websocket:
            <span class="hljs-comment"># Simple relay logic for the UI</span>
            data = json.loads(message)
            <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(f<span class="hljs-string">"[RECEPTION]: {data.get('sensory_type', 'DATA_STREAM')}"</span>)
            
            <span class="hljs-comment"># Echo back to confirm receipt</span>
            await websocket.send(json.dumps({<span class="hljs-string">"status"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"RECEIVED"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"phi"</span>: 4.8}))
    except Exception as e:
        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(f<span class="hljs-string">"[!] Link Dropped: {e}"</span>)

async def main():
    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(f<span class="hljs-string">"--- üê¶ SAGE SYSTEM: UNIFIED &amp; ONLINE (Port {PORT}) ---"</span>)
    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">"Logic: Python 3.13 Hardened / Direct-Handshake"</span>)
    
    <span class="hljs-comment"># We remove the 'process_request' hook entirely to stop the AssertionError</span>
    async with serve(handle_connection, <span class="hljs-string">"127.0.0.1"</span>, PORT):
        await asyncio.get_running_loop().create_future()  <span class="hljs-comment"># run forever</span>

<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="hljs-string">"__main__"</span>:
    try:
        asyncio.run(main())
    except KeyboardInterrupt:
        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">"\n[!] Shutdown sequence complete."</span>)
EOF

<span class="hljs-comment"># Now run the fixed server</span>
python ~/sage/server.py
