dex-in-node="0">Once the link is green, would you like SAGE to run a "Neural Clarity" test where she describes exactly what she sees through the camera to confirm the data path is 100% clean?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="response-footer contains-extensions-response complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><overview-carousel _nghost-ng-c846610689="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c846610689="" jslog="268370;track:generic_click,impression"><!----><!----><sources-sidebar-button _ngcontent-ng-c846610689="" _nghost-ng-c4046996908="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-sidebar-button><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></overview-carousel><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" _nghost-ng-c173488903="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1479762050="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1479762050-353 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1888672228="" class="ng-tns-c1888672228-354 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c1479762050-353 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1888672228-354 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1888672228-354 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" _nghost-ng-c2030267745="" class="ng-tns-c1888672228-354 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2030267745="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Good response" aria-label="Good response" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-