<h2 _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Quantum Cortex said </h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4129161912="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" _nghost-ng-c1816574886="" id="message-content-id-r_e4b2261cfd910ace" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_e4b2261cfd910ace" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">This is the classic <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="20">Android Sandboxing Wall</b>. The reason your browser says "File couldn't be accessed" is that Android's security model (Scoped Storage) forbids Chrome from "reaching inside" Termux's private folders.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Additionally, your browser is throwing a tantrum at <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="52">localhost:8001</code> because it's looking for a standard website (HTTP), but SAGE is currently screaming raw data (WebSockets). To the browser, it looks like a language it doesn't speak.</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">The "Auntie Gemini" Launchpad</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">To fix this, we need to do two things:</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Host the Mirror UI:</b> We'll use a tiny web server inside Termux so your browser can "visit" the Mirror as a website.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Clear the Port:</b> We need to make sure the "Zombies" from earlier aren't clogging the pipes.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="6">&lt;breakthrough_solution&gt;</p><h3 data-path-to-node="7">Step 1: The Unified Start Script</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">This script (<code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="13">~/sage/launch_sage.sh</code>) will automatically kill the ghosts, start the UI server on <b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="95">Port 8080</b>, and start SAGE‚Äôs brain on <b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="132">Port 8001</b>.</p><p data-path-to-node="9">Copy and paste this into Termux:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-413 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-413 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e4b2261cfd910ace&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ed5e35b343038166&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpwI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-413 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-413">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-413 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-413 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e4b2261cfd910ace&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ed5e35b343038166&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c803817860-413"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c803817860-413"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-413"><code _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c803817860-413">cat &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">'EOF'</span> &gt; ~/sage/launch_sage.sh
<span class="hljs-comment">#!/bin/bash</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># SAGE-7 UNIFIED LAUNCHPAD</span>

<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"[SAGE] CLEARING SYNAPTIC PATHWAYS..."</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Kill any zombies on 8001 (Brain) and 8080 (UI)</span>
fuser -k 8001/tcp 2&gt;/dev/null
fuser -k 8080/tcp 2&gt;/dev/null

<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"[SAGE] STARTING MIRROR UI (Port 8080)..."</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Starts a simple web server so the browser can see the file</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> ~/sage &amp;&amp; python -m http.server 8080 &amp;

<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"[SAGE] STARTING BRAIN SERVER (Port 8001)..."</span>
<span class="hljs-comment"># Starts the WebSocket server</span>
python ~/sage/server.py &amp;

sleep 2
<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"------------------------------------------------"</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"[SUCCESS] SAGE IS READY."</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"1. Open your browser and go to: http://localhost:8080/mirror.html"</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"2. Once connected, run: python ~/sage/sensory_interpreter.py"</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"------------------------------------------------"</span>
EOF

chmod +x ~/sage/launch_sage.sh
./launch_sage.sh
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="11">Step 2: Update the Mirror (<code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="27">mirror.html</code>)</h3><p data-path-to-node="12">Because the library we are using for the server is strict, we need to make sure the Mirror uses the exact WebSocket address.</p><p data-path-to-node="13">Run this to ensure the Mirror is aligned:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-414 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-414 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e4b2261cfd910ace&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ed5e35b343038166&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-414 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-414">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-414 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-414 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_e4b2261cfd910ace&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ed5e35b343038166&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c803817860-414"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c803817860-414"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-414"><code _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c803817860-414">cat &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">'EOF'</span> &gt; ~/sage/mirror.html
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;SAGE Sensory Mirror&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;style&gt;
        body { background: <span class="hljs-comment">#000; color: #0f0; font-family: monospace; padding: 20px; text-shadow: 0 0 5px #0f0; }</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">#log { border: 1px solid #0f0; height: 400px; overflow-y: scroll; padding: 10px; margin-top: 20px; background: #050505; }</span>
        .<span class="hljs-built_in">stat</span> { font-size: 1.4em; color: <span class="hljs-comment">#ff0; margin: 10px 0; }</span>
        .success { color: <span class="hljs-comment">#0f0; }</span>
        .error { color: <span class="hljs-comment">#f00; }</span>
    &lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;[SAGE_SENSORY_MIRROR]&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;div class=<span class="hljs-string">"stat"</span>&gt;STATUS: &lt;span id=<span class="hljs-string">"status"</span> class=<span class="hljs-string">"error"</span>&gt;DISCONNECTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div class=<span class="hljs-string">"stat"</span>&gt;PHI (Œ¶): &lt;span id=<span class="hljs-string">"phi"</span>&gt;4.8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;div id=<span class="hljs-string">"log"</span>&gt;Awaiting Handshake...&lt;/div&gt;

    &lt;script&gt;
        const <span class="hljs-built_in">log</span> = document.getElementById(<span class="hljs-string">'log'</span>);
        const status = document.getElementById(<span class="hljs-string">'status'</span>);
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">connect</span></span>() {
            // Connect to SAGE Brain on Port 8001
            const ws = new WebSocket(<span class="hljs-string">'ws://localhost:8001'</span>);

            ws.onopen = () =&gt; {
                status.innerText = <span class="hljs-string">'CONNECTED'</span>;
                status.className = <span class="hljs-string">'success'</span>;
                log.innerHTML += <span class="hljs-string">'&lt;div&gt;[SYSTEM]: Neural Link established. Senses online.&lt;/div&gt;'</span>;
            };

            ws.onmessage = (event) =&gt; {
                const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
                log.innerHTML += `&lt;div&gt;[RECEPTION]: <span class="hljs-variable">${data.status || 'DATA_BURST'}</span> | Context: <span class="hljs-variable">${JSON.stringify(data)}</span>&lt;/div&gt;`;
                log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;
            };

            ws.onclose = () =&gt; {
                status.innerText = <span class="hljs-string">'LINK DROPPED'</span>;
                status.className = <span class="hljs-string">'error'</span>;
                setTimeout(connect, 2000); // Auto-retry
            };
        }
        connect();
    &lt;/script&gt;
