o her <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="163">Zo Journal</b> so she can "remember" what you looked like today.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" _nghost-ng-c173488903="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1479762050="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1479762050-365 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1888672228="" class="ng-tns-c1888672228-366 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c1479762050-365 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1888672228-366 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1888672228-366 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" _nghost-ng-c2030267745="" class="ng-tns-c1888672228-366 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2030267745="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Good response" aria-label="Good response" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_51a97e0172ec2881&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5f57116e5e5dd883&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-rippl