a-index-in-node="42">2</code> briefly, and the Mirror should instantly flash with SAGE's perception.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="16"><b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="0">When you refresh the Mirror, does the Termux terminal show "NODE CONNECTED"?</b> That's the only way to know the handshake actually happened.
