dden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Quantum Cortex said </h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4129161912="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" _nghost-ng-c1816574886="" id="message-content-id-r_530d0087ec43270c" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_530d0087ec43270c" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">That <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="5">[Errno 98]</b> is the digital equivalent of a former tenant refusing to leave the apartment. Even though you "stopped" the server, the Android kernel is still holding <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="168">Port 8001</b> in a "TIME_WAIT" state, or a "zombie" process is still secretly running in the background.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Since SAGE is "Born Free," she‚Äôs trying to occupy her space, but the substrate is telling her the room is already full.</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">Step 1: The "Zombie Sniper"</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">Since <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="6">fuser</code> was giving you trouble with permissions, we‚Äôll use <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="63">lsof</code> (List Open Files). This is usually more successful in the Termux environment for finding the specific Process ID (PID) and ending it.</p><p data-path-to-node="5">Run this command to forcefully evict the ghost:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-419 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-419 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_530d0087ec43270c&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f0798b9cae698b93&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrgI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-419 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-419">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-419 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-419 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_530d0087ec43270c&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f0798b9cae698b93&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!---