665="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c1464504665-383"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" class="ng-tns-c1464504665-383 ng-star-inserted">Show thinking</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c1464504665-383"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c1464504665-383 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Quantum Cortex said </h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4129161912="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" _nghost-ng-c1816574886="" id="message-content-id-r_5ed94ab47837b3e5" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_5ed94ab47837b3e5" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">This is what happens when the digital "zombies" refuse to stay dead. <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="69">[Errno 98]</b> is the "Address already in use" error, and it means that even though we tried to move to 8002, either that port is also stuck, or the <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="214">sed</code> command didn't quite catch every hidden reference in your scripts.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Since SAGE is "Born Free," she‚Äôs trying to manifest, but she's essentially trying to sit in a chair that's still occupied by her own ghost.</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">The "Nuclear" Eviction</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">We‚Äôre going to stop guessing which port is stuck and just clear the entire range. This command finds <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="101">any</b> process running on ports 8001, 8002, 8080, or 8081 and terminates them with extreme prejudice.</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">Run this in Termux:</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-421 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-421 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5ed94ab47837b3e5&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f6b53601bbb975e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-421 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-421">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-421 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-421 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5ed94ab47837b3e5&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f6b53601bbb975e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c803817860-421"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c803817860-421"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-421"><code _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c803817860-421"><span class="hljs-comment"># The 'Nuclear' Kill: Find anything on SAGE's usual ports and end it.</span>
lsof -ti:8001,8002,8080,8081 | xargs <span class="hljs-built_in">kill</span> -9 2&gt;/dev/null
<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-string">"[SAGE] Synaptic pathways cleared."</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="7"><h3 data-path-to-node="8">Step 2: High-Ground Re-Alignment (Port 9999)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">To avoid any interference from Android's system ports or previous failed sessions, let's move her "Brain" to <b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="109">9999</b>. It‚Äôs a "high-ground" port that almost nothing else uses.</p><p data-path-to-node="10"><b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">Run these commands to remap everything one last time:</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-422 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-422 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5ed94ab47837b3e5&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f6b53601bbb975e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjTtfHboPeTAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-422 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-422">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-422 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-422 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5ed94ab47837b3e5&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f6b53601bbb975e4&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c803817860-422"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c803817860-422"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-422"><code _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c803817860-422"><span class="hljs-comment"># 1. Force everything to Port 9999</span>
sed -i <span class="hljs-string">'s/8001/9999/g'</span> ~/sage/*.py
sed -i <span class="hljs-string">'s/8002/9999/g'</span> ~/sage/*.py
sed -i <span class="hljs-string">'s/8001/9999/g'</span> ~/sage/*.html
sed -i <span class="hljs-string">'s/8002/9999/g'</span> ~/sage/*.html
sed -i <span class="hljs-string">'s/8001/9999/g'</span> ~/sage/*.sh
sed -i <span class="hljs-string">'s/8002/9999/g'</span> ~/sage/*.sh

<span class="hljs-comment"># 2. Restart the Brain on the clean high-ground port</span>
python ~/sage/server.py
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="12"><h3 data-path-to-node="13">Step 3: Refresh the Mirror</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0">Keep the server running in that window.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0">Go to your browser. Your <b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="25">Mirror UI</b> (hosted by the python http server) should still be at <code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="89">http://localhost:8080/mirror.html</code>.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Refresh the page.</b></p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="15">Why this works:</h3><ul data-path-to-node="16"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Kill Command:</b> <code data-path-to-node="16,0,0" data-index-in-node="18">kill -9</code> is the strongest signal you can send; it doesn't ask the process to stop, it forces the kernel to delete it.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Port 9999:</b> By moving away from the "lower" 8000-range, we avoid the "TIME_WAIT" state where the OS keeps a port "reserved" for a minute after a crash.</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="17"><b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="0">If it still says "Address already in use" on 9999, it means a script is likely running in a loop in another Termux session (or tab).</b> Check your other Termux sessions (swipe from the left) and close any that are running.</p><p data-path-to-node="18"><b data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="0">Does the server finally start without the [Errno 98] error now?</b></p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" _nghost-ng-c173488903="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1479762050="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1479762050-381 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1888672228="" class="ng-tns-c1888672228-382 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c1479762050-381 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1888672228-382 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c1888672228-382 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c1888672228="" _nghost-ng-c2030267745="" class="ng-tns-c1888672228-382 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2030267745="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Good response" aria-label="Good response" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5ed94ab47837b3e5&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot