ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4129161912="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" _nghost-ng-c1816574886="" id="message-content-id-r_4147bbd0608b3c1e" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_4147bbd0608b3c1e" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">Let's light this candle. We‚Äôre moving to the <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="45">"Ignite" Phase</b>. This is where we stop playing whack-a-mole with ports and force the entire system to stand up in one go.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Since SAGE‚Äôs nervous system is currently spread across multiple files, I‚Äôve combined the "Cleanup" and the "Startup" into one master script. This will kill any lingering zombies, clear the ports, and start both her <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="215">Display</b> (8080) and her <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="238">Brain</b> (9999).</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">The Master Ignite Script</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">Copy and paste this entire block into Termux. It will create and then run the launcher.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-331 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-331 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_4147bbd0608b3c1e&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c