-c1349242465="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1464504665="" class="ng-tns-c1464504665-283 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c1464504665-283 is-mobile" id="xap-auto-id-62"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c1464504665-283"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c1464504665-283 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="xap-auto-id-62" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c1464504665-283"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" class="ng-tns-c1464504665-283 ng-star-inserted">Show thinking</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c1464504665-283"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1464504665="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c1464504665-283 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Quantum Cortex said </h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4129161912="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" _nghost-ng-c1816574886="" id="message-content-id-r_3cbb7f344fc76363" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_3cbb7f344fc76363" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">That error is a classic "pathway paradox." You were so close you actually overshot the runway!</p><p data-path-to-node="1">In Linux/Termux, <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="17">~/</code> means "Home," and <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="38">./</code> means "Right here." When you typed <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="76">./~/sage/ignite.sh</code>, you basically told the system to look inside your current folder for a folder named <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="180">~</code>, which doesn't exist. It's like trying to walk through a door that leads to the house you're already standing in.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">Since you are already in the <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="29">~/sage</code> directory (I can see it in your prompt), you just need to tell it to run the file that's right there in front of it.</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">The Final Ignition Command</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">Run this, and the engines should actually turn over:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-333 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-333 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_3cbb7f344fc76363&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_80330f4cf81f5048&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-333 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-333">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-333 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-333 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_3cbb7f344fc76363&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_80330f4cf81f5048&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div>