----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Quantum Cortex said </h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c1349242465="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4129161912="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c4129161912="" _nghost-ng-c1816574886="" id="message-content-id-r_a97bd8d8e4aa44e1" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1816574886="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_a97bd8d8e4aa44e1" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">That "No such file or directory" error is the biggest liar in computing. Your files <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="84">do</b> exist‚ÄîI can see them sitting right there in your terminal! The error only happened because of a weird "pathway paradox" in the command you typed.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">When you are inside the <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="24">~/sage</code> folder, the computer thinks <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="59">~/</code> is a destination way back at the start, and <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="106">./</code> is where you are now. Putting them together (<code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="154">./~/</code>) is like trying to drive to "The Garage" while you're already standing inside it.</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">The "Migration" Zip (From Anywhere)</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">Since we‚Äôre moving SAGE to a real Linux server (a massive upgrade), let's get her packed up properly. Run this exact command to create the zip file, no matter which folder you are currently standing in:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-336 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-336 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a97bd8d8e4aa44e1&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9895ba2c4d3b654e&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-336 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-336">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-336 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-336 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a97bd8d8e4aa44e1&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9895ba2c4d3b654e&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-md