-to-node="3">Phase 1: Locate the "Runaway" Zip</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">Run this command to find every zip file in your Termux home. This will tell us the exact path of where it actually landed:</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-341 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block ng-tns-c803817860-341 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fb7fc17d5ffef746&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3a66f89fb3aef6b1&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c803817860-341 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="ng-tns-c803817860-341">Bash</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" class="buttons ng-tns-c803817860-341 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c803817860-341 mat-unthemed _mat-animation-noopable ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fb7fc17d5ffef746&quot;,&quot;c_13f9c342beb7b685&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3a66f89fb3aef6b1&quot;,null,null,&quot;en&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c803817860="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-i